# "Start a brief" form → Notion (app/api/brief/route.ts)
#
# Setup (one time):
#   1. Create an internal integration at https://www.notion.so/my-integrations
#      (Capabilities: Insert content is enough). Copy its secret.
#   2. Open the "Inbound Briefs" database in Notion → ... menu → Connections →
#      add your integration so it can write rows.
#   3. In Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables, add the two below
#      (Production), then redeploy.
#
# Until NOTION_TOKEN is set the form gracefully falls back to the email link.

NOTION_TOKEN=
NOTION_BRIEFS_DB_ID=783b67ca-0ab5-4ff8-90a3-829d12d0bc88
